### REST Client (VS Code) — jalankan backend pada http://localhost:3000
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@missingId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000

### 1. GET semua data (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/visit-plans

### 2. POST tambah data (201)
# @name createPlan
POST {{baseUrl}}/visit-plans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Liburan Akhir Pekan",
  "destinationId": "baturraden",
  "destinationName": "Lokawisata Baturraden",
  "visitDate": "2027-01-20",
  "participantCount": 2,
  "isCompleted": false
}

### 3. GET satu data (200) — jalankan POST di atas terlebih dahulu
GET {{baseUrl}}/visit-plans/{{createPlan.response.body.$.id}}

### 4. POST duplikat (409 Conflict) — jalankan sebelum PATCH/DELETE
POST {{baseUrl}}/visit-plans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Liburan Akhir Pekan",
  "destinationId": "baturraden",
  "destinationName": "Lokawisata Baturraden",
  "visitDate": "2027-01-20",
  "participantCount": 2,
  "isCompleted": false
}

### 5. PATCH edit data (200)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/visit-plans/{{createPlan.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Liburan Bersama Keluarga",
  "participantCount": 4,
  "isCompleted": true
}

### 6. POST data tidak valid (400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/visit-plans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "X",
  "destinationId": "baturraden",
  "destinationName": "Lokawisata Baturraden",
  "visitDate": "tanggal-salah",
  "participantCount": 0,
  "isCompleted": "bukan-boolean"
}

### 7. DELETE hapus data (200)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/visit-plans/{{createPlan.response.body.$.id}}

### 8. GET ID tidak ada (404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/visit-plans/{{missingId}}
